{"book":"proverbs","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:27:45.010450345Z","verse":20,"ref":"proverbs 28:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":28,"translation":"A man of faithfulness ⟨abounds⟩ in abundant blessings, and ⟨he who is⟩ hasty to get rich will not go unpunished.","tokens":[{"surface":"איש","gloss":"a man"},{"surface":"אמונות","gloss":"of faithfulness"},{"surface":"רב","gloss":"⟨abounds⟩ in abundant"},{"surface":"ברכות","gloss":"blessings"},{"surface":"ואץ","gloss":"and ⟨he who is⟩ hasty"},{"surface":"להעשיר","gloss":"to get rich"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"shall not"},{"surface":"ינקה","gloss":"innocent"}]}